			"notes": "Dino Printer v1.3.1 for MC 26.3\n\nNot using MC 26.3? Browse the [releases](https://github.com/Gingerbeard5773/dino-printer/releases) tab to find your MC version. v1.3.1 has backports all the way down to 1.21.4.\n\nWARNING: Meteor 26.3 is not yet fully compatible with Litematica and a crash can happen.\nIf you use Litematica with Meteor 26.3, **DO NOT USE THE ESP OR CHAMS MODULES**.\n\nv1.3.1 [Changelog](https://github.com/Gingerbeard5773/dino-printer/releases/tag/v1.3.1%2Bmc26.2)"
		},
