			"notes": "Dino Printer v1.3.1 for MC 26.2\n\nv1.3.1 is a hotfix for v1.3.0\n\n* Fixed issue with sneak placement failing when placing chests.\n* Fixed issue with incremental blocks/ slabs soft locking.\n\nChangelog from v1.3.0 :arrow_down: \n* Fixed sneak-placement desync causing ghost items in inventory.\n* **Fluids** (lava and water) can now be placed using buckets if wanted.\n* Hanging signs, tripwire, and incremental blocks now place correctly.\n* Added **Interact** (auto interaction) which is great for redstone components, trapdoors, noteblocks, etc.\n* Added settings to render a box outline when placing.\n* Fixed an issue where certain unique blocks wouldn't place due to sneak-placement.\n* Important items no longer will swap out of the hotbar. This includes but not limited to: food, enchanted items, xp, and totems.\n* Added option **Rotate Legit Move** which **fixes rubberbanding while rotating and moving** (movefix for grim). \n\nThose of you updating from an older Dino Printer version, **Remember to update your configs.** Configs for certain servers are provided in the [Readme](https://github.com/Gingerbeard5773/dino-printer/blob/main/README.md)."
		},
